        <mxCell id="p1-publisher" value="&lt;b&gt;9 · Transactional Outbox&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Versioned actor events&lt;br&gt;at-least-once publish&lt;br&gt;consumer-safe dedupe keys" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#ea580c;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0f172a;spacing=10;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
